  "cards":[
    {"id":"reranker-stage","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"concept-reranker-contract","question":"CrossEncoder 在检索流水线的哪一阶段？","aliases":["重排器是全库检索器吗"],"keywords":["CrossEncoder","阶段","重排器","全库检索器"],"diagnostic":"检查是否只处理第一阶段有界候选。","hints":["查看 #concept-reranker-contract。","先召回再重排。"],"example":"candidate_pool最多20。","answer":"它是第一阶段召回后的第二阶段重排器，只读取有界候选池，不扫描全库。","source":{"label":"重排器契约","href":"#concept-reranker-contract"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"rerank-budget","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"concept-reranker-contract","question":"为什么重排候选池必须有上限？","aliases":["CrossEncoder为什么不能处理所有chunk"],"keywords":["重排","候选池","上限","所有chunk"],"diagnostic":"检查输入规模、延迟和成本。","hints":["查看 #concept-reranker-contract。","记录池大小和耗时。"],"example":"top20 rerank。","answer":"联合编码比初筛昂贵，无上限会让延迟和成本随语料增长并绕开预算。","source":{"label":"重排器契约","href":"#concept-reranker-contract"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"fixed-adapter-boundary","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"concept-reranker-contract","question":"固定重排 adapter 能证明真实模型效果吗？","aliases":["CI的词项重排能代表CrossEncoder吗"],"keywords":["固定adapter","真实模型","CI","CrossEncoder"],"diagnostic":"区分接口确定性测试和模型效果。","hints":["查看 #concept-reranker-contract。","本机不下载模型。"],"example":"real-cross-encoder:false。","answer":"不能；它只验证接口、排序和边界，真实模型必须独立运行并用同一评估集比较。","source":{"label":"重排器契约","href":"#concept-reranker-contract"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"citation-coordinates","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"concept-extractive-compression","question":"压缩后精确引用要保留哪些字段？","aliases":["语义压缩怎样保住引用"],"keywords":["压缩","精确引用","字段","引用保真"],"diagnostic":"检查来源、版本、位置和字符范围。","hints":["查看 #concept-extractive-compression。","验证原文切片相等。"],"example":"source+version+page+block+chunk+start/end。","answer":"保留来源、版本、页/块、chunk ID 和 start/end，并验证原文切片等于证据文本。","source":{"label":"抽取式压缩","href":"#concept-extractive-compression"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"generated-summary-boundary","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"concept-extractive-compression","question":"生成式摘要能直接作为逐字引用吗？","aliases":["摘要可以继承原文坐标吗"],"keywords":["生成式摘要","逐字引用","原文坐标"],"diagnostic":"检查新文本是否被错误标成原文。","hints":["查看 #concept-extractive-compression。","新文本不是原句切片。"],"example":"citation_valid返回false。","answer":"不能；生成摘要是新文本，除非另有可验证映射，否则不能继承原文坐标或冒充逐字证据。","source":{"label":"抽取式压缩","href":"#concept-extractive-compression"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"context-pipeline","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"overview-context-selection","question":"候选变成上下文包经过哪些阶段？","aliases":["上下文选择完整流水线是什么"],"keywords":["候选","上下文包","流水线","阶段"],"diagnostic":"检查五阶段计数。","hints":["查看 #overview-context-selection。","从retrieved开始。"],"example":"retrieved→reranked→extracted→deduped→selected。","answer":"依次是召回、重排、抽取、去重和有预算的选择。","source":{"label":"上下文选择闭环","href":"#overview-context-selection"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"mmr-diversity","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"example-context-selection","question":"MMR 式选择解决什么问题？","aliases":["为什么上下文需要来源多样性"],"keywords":["MMR","来源多样性","上下文"],"diagnostic":"检查相关性与重复来源的平衡。","hints":["查看 #example-context-selection。","多样性不是随机。"],"example":"相关且不同来源优先。","answer":"它在相关性足够的前提下惩罚重复内容，避免一个来源占满上下文。","source":{"label":"上下文选择流水线","href":"#example-context-selection"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"lost-middle","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"example-context-selection","question":"怎样缓解 lost in the middle？","aliases":["重要证据为什么放上下文两端"],"keywords":["lost in the middle","重要证据","上下文两端"],"diagnostic":"检查长上下文的证据位置。","hints":["查看 #example-context-selection。","最高相关开头，第二高末尾。"],"example":"rank1 first, rank2 last。","answer":"把最重要证据分布在开头和末尾，避免关键内容全部埋在长上下文中部。","source":{"label":"上下文选择流水线","href":"#example-context-selection"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"hard-budget","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"troubleshoot-context-selection","question":"上下文预算为什么要在选择时硬执行？","aliases":["最后再截断Prompt可以吗"],"keywords":["上下文预算","硬执行","截断Prompt"],"diagnostic":"检查是否会切断证据和引用。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-context-selection。","完整证据逐条装入。"],"example":"characters<=budget。","answer":"事后截断可能切断句子和引用；选择阶段应只装入能完整容纳的证据。","source":{"label":"上下文选择排错","href":"#troubleshoot-context-selection"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"real-reranker-adapter","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"modify-add-model-adapter","question":"接入真实重排模型要记录什么？","aliases":["真实CrossEncoder adapter如何可复现"],"keywords":["真实重排模型","CrossEncoder","可复现","adapter"],"diagnostic":"检查版本、分数方向、候选上限和耗时。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-model-adapter。","独立可选依赖。"],"example":"model revision + top20 + latency。","answer":"记录模型名和修订、分数方向、候选池上限、耗时及失败回退，并在独立环境评估。","source":{"label":"接入真实重排器","href":"#modify-add-model-adapter"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"layered-context-eval","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"deepen-rerank-evaluation","question":"重排压缩和上下文要怎样分层评估？","aliases":["只看最终答案能评估上下文吗"],"keywords":["重排","压缩","上下文","分层评估","最终答案"],"diagnostic":"检查每层是否有独立指标。","hints":["查看 #deepen-rerank-evaluation。","错误不能都归给生成模型。"],"example":"nDCG、坐标有效率、证据覆盖。","answer":"分别看重排排名，压缩保留率和坐标有效率，以及上下文覆盖、多样性、预算与位置。","source":{"label":"分层评估","href":"#deepen-rerank-evaluation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
    {"id":"assistant-v29","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-05","context_id":"project-learning-assistant-v29","question":"智能学习助手 v0.29 新增什么？","aliases":["RAG应用工程第五课做什么"],"keywords":["智能学习助手","v0.29","RAG应用工程第五课"],"diagnostic":"定位上下文选择增量。","hints":["查看 #project-learning-assistant-v29。","运行8项测试。"],"example":"Reranker和ContextCompressor。","answer":"新增有界重排、抽取式压缩、坐标保真、去重、多样性、硬预算和中部遗失排序。","source":{"label":"智能学习助手v0.29","href":"#project-learning-assistant-v29"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false}
